    "change_record": "FW-2678-NATIVE-HOST-CONTRACT-01",
    "statement": "The supported native-host contract: every command runs, in this order, as its own step in each leaf of the ci.yml native-host-contract matrix. bin/native-host-evidence validates the hosted results; it runs nothing itself. Adding, removing or renaming a selected test method is a reviewed change to this file (tests/Architecture/NativeHostContractWorkflowTest.php derives the selection from source and compares).",
